{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "458542026efd6881",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A sermon for Holy Pascha by John Chrysostom, Archbishop of Constantinople."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f15087afec8c9466",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Rejoice in the Lord always, beloved brothers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "c54cbb9515639599",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again I say, rejoice. The Lord is near; do not be anxious about anything. The Lord has risen from the dead,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "3f694fcd74c16d68",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and with him a great multitude of saints. Let us therefore celebrate joyfully and with self-control."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "8a2d526e49ed8ee6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this is truly the day that the Lord has made. Let us rejoice and be glad in it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "4d3a168e21eab42b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us proclaim the remembrance of the day of salvation. Let us proclaim the resurrection of our Savior."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "4df5cac35d7c6cbb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or rather, let us cry out our salvation. Let us proclaim the putting to death of the devil,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "0c1ceca4dcc2b941",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the captivity of the unclean demons, the salvation of Christians, the resurrection of the dead."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "7510314fd83632b1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For through Christ’s resurrection, fiery Gehenna will be extinguished."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "0800e27e3ba20264",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The sleepless worm dies. Hades is in turmoil. The devil mourns."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "b80a22ee07476e59",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Sin is put to death. Evil spirits are driven out."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "53b422a4897c1c60",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Those on earth ascend to heaven. Those in Hades are freed from the devil’s bonds,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "b70b4050798cbd2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and, taking refuge in God, they say to the devil, “Where, O death, is your sting? Where, O Hades, is your victory?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "22e36358db4994f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The reason for our holy feast and this celebration is Christ, who is also the mediator for us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s15",
      "source_sha256": "aaf8299c89a7604e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of all good things. For he created us in the beginning, bringing us from nonexistence into existence."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240r.s16",
      "source_sha256": "26fc7a6b6070a4fc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He has now also saved us when we were perishing, brought us to life when we were dead, and the enemy’s opposition"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "26b3bf7c11ddf093",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he has taken away. When we were slaves to sin, he made us free, wiping out our written record of debt."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "d8e70a6e59542439",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Christ,” it says, “redeemed us from the curse of the law, becoming a curse for us.” Therefore we too ought to say,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "3dfa8cbb19b0d15e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“What shall I give back to the Lord for all that you have given us?” Being the only-begotten God, he chose to become a man for our sake,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "0e769e767c2bacf8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and he became obedient unto death, so that he might deliver us from eternal death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "710fd6571df3563f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Master of the angels clothed himself in the form of a servant. God the Word took flesh"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "57c7f8ecffd44b5b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and appeared as a man, being of the same form and the same nature as the Father."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "6d1c91726100baa6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He suffered these things to rescue us from bondage to unrighteousness and deliver us from ungodliness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "30c843fcaf4a5d11",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this reason the giver of our life endured suffering in the flesh. For this reason he was also buried,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "e3bde1a969373dab",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the fountain of immortality, so that he might give everlasting life to mortals."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "3d08030539984a08",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again, as he did good on earth and healed human afflictions, from the Jews who fought against God he undeservedly"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "691d28414327c959",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "received recompense. But our Lord Jesus Christ, out of his great goodness,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "f11835b5969bd4ec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "cleansed lepers, gave sight to the blind, and healed the lame."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "08a05f128b1a7ae3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He drove out demons and raised Lazarus from the dead after he had been dead for four days."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "6209c3e236baf24f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He fed five thousand with five loaves, walked on the sea, and changed water into wine."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s15",
      "source_sha256": "b6e1f15ffa5eadf9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He healed the woman suffering from bleeding and brought the synagogue leader’s dead daughter back to life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s16",
      "source_sha256": "00613c6603edb8d3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he performed many other mysteries and worthy miracles. But the Jews, gripped by envy and jealousy,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.240v.s17",
      "source_sha256": "bbb15f6ac446bd19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "sometimes pelted the Lord with stones, and at other times tried to throw him down from the walls."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "79155eae14bbe44d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Finally, they even led him to the cross. But our Lord Jesus Christ did not imitate"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "c9c5a95b42bb591e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the malice of the blasphemous Jews. Instead, he offered his back to blows, according to the prophecy,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "394c65bd177e2e88",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and his cheeks to slaps, and did not turn his face away from the shame of being spat upon."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "c515b9b38c17151f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And finally, he was led like a sheep to slaughter."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "c009ba1c76759614",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And like a lamb silent before its shearer, he neither resisted nor argued."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "769e76ff1b677345",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When reviled, he did not revile in return; when suffering, he did not threaten, but entrusted himself to the one who judges justly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "75d3bb7d1eae89ec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For at his first coming he did not come to torment and punish unbelievers,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "5719730eb46d0d7f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but wished through patience and endurance to guide those who had gone astray to the truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "d70c24ec0afb686d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And recognize the Lord’s great goodness: the Jews reviled him and said"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "baa9e659dce8c5d8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to him, “You have a demon.” But the Lord, being patient, drove out demons."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "5f963e495c967ae4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Jews spat in the Lord’s face, but he healed their blind."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "1cf61609ab65a533",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Jews pelted Christ with stones, but Christ gave their lame the ability to run."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "9769435a27ce1e9e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And in every way he continued to the end doing good to those who mistreated him, and giving good in return for evil"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "11f2870a97810012",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to those ungrateful and defiled people, meekly enduring slander."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s15",
      "source_sha256": "3ce645e4e9c114be",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he was thought weak, though he received honor from angels. And so that I do not prolong my account,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s16",
      "source_sha256": "7610115c27994aa9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "let us come to the very heart of the matter. Finally, he was led to the cross and to death,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241r.s17",
      "source_sha256": "91038a8b4814cb0b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the glorious King, and was nailed to the wood, he who is glorified by the cherubim and seraphim."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "79fbfa7f118ce5dc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and receiving worship from all the angelic powers. Yet he meekly accepted and suffered these things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "0b15ed37fc1f8d04",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "giving us an example and becoming a teacher of meekness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "bd3503f88ea51f89",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this reason, we too must endure the threats of wicked people."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "43683a38ee3bb9a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But even when he was hung on the cross, he displayed greater deeds and more numerous miracles,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "148717deb1ea23bb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that at least in this way he might stop the frenzy of those who hate God, so that they might have no excuse for unbelief,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "858496fb37d28b19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor say, “We crucified an ordinary man.” First, then, Christ endured being crucified"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "80fbb06e5c693bbb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to drive away the demons that dwell in the air. He was hung on wood so that the sin committed long ago"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "1b3795e27adf204b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "through wood might be healed for humanity through wood. He was also pierced in the side with a spear"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "1e2d0cd12f0eab0b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because of the woman taken from Adam’s side. For the serpent deceived Eve,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "7bf1b4081ce70e82",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and Eve caused Adam to transgress, and a sentence was pronounced against them both."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "593e074380d578e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And death reigned from Adam to Moses, even over those who had not sinned."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "a3fe357be8e7b86e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this reason his side was pierced, so that we might know that Christ’s suffering brought salvation not only to men but also to women."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "c59c47c2e2502191",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For Adam was formed first, and then Eve. And Adam was not deceived, but the woman fell into disobedience."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "e412ce00a7a51cd9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But she will be saved through childbearing. Through what childbearing? Is it not through the birth of Mary’s child?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s15",
      "source_sha256": "a42e86a505e418f1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For she bore Christ the Savior without having been with a man, as Isaiah testifies,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.241v.s16",
      "source_sha256": "7e2986e9b201f8de",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but with the Holy Spirit overshadowing her, as the archangel Gabriel announced. For this reason also, the side"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "1cb1b301d0df6cc6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of Christ is pierced, so that what was foretold might be fulfilled, and the mysteries of baptism might be proclaimed,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "11d9fd4bf02f281b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "along with the grace that was to shine forth. For blood and water flowed from Christ’s side,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "f4efc57602f96131",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that he might erase the written record of our sins, and we might be cleansed by his blood and receive [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "3b49d7dc8aeab654",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O great mystery! The robber repented. [?] water to be found so that he could be baptized."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "0b0d530f9395a05a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He was hanging on the cross. There was no means of baptism at all: neither a spring nor a pool,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "653edc9c8573e29a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "neither rain nor anyone to offer prayers. For all the disciples had fled for fear of the Jews."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "c1f9b276bea6a8bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But Jesus did not lack water; even while hanging on the cross, he was the Creator of the waters."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "d999ec1062062960",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Since, then, there was no way for the robber to enter the kingdom of heaven"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a2eb84de092a5f82",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "without baptism, it was fitting that, having repented, he should not be deprived of baptism."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "9aadccac5bbe0d91",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Savior poured out water and blood from his pierced side,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "b9be82b24ae66c24",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that he might also free the robber from the evils that beset him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "9ccff62f03342d9e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and reveal his blood as redemption for those who place their hope in him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "31e4ca72b5e4e4b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For if the blood of a bull and a goat, and the ashes of a heifer sprinkled"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "ec466b1a33865dd5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "on the defiled, sanctify them for the cleansing of the flesh, how much more has the blood of Christ our Savior"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s15",
      "source_sha256": "6026b511e1f51ced",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "become cleansing for all Christians. If one of the unbelievers says to you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s16",
      "source_sha256": "0447b9fb30f1ee02",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Why was Christ crucified?” tell him, “So that he might destroy the sin that arose in the human race"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s17",
      "source_sha256": "9b063a5c3e046b68",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "by means of a tree.” If he says to you, “Why did he also wear thorns?” tell him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242r.s18",
      "source_sha256": "d03cca454e67f421",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“So that he might uproot Adam’s thorns and thistles. For Adam was condemned to groan and tremble, and thorns"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "ec0230e76c8a8094",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and to produce thorns and thistles. But Jesus, who loves humankind, wishing to care for his creation,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "224306953f96464c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "suffered everything for our sake, so that we might be free from condemnation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "659925f0afbbba48",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Just as he was born of a woman to wash away the sin that had come upon humankind,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "2a8be777bed5f400",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so he was also crowned with thorns, so that the earth, made harsh to cultivate by sin,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "e4fe87ee10858985",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "might be made gentler through his obedience.” If someone says to you, “Why did he drink gall and vinegar?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "a26d970e102f924a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "tell him, “So that we might vomit up the serpent’s deadly poison."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "78c2e15fe410014c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For that gall became sweetness and healing for us.” If the unbeliever says to you again,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "f9c908afca40822c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Why did they approach him and bow before him on their knees?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "0fbfac96293acac6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "tell him, “So that the Jews might bow before him even unwillingly, and proclaim his kingship on earth against their will."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "8fce4e1166de5129",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now, then, they bow in mockery, not knowing what they are doing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "5e077db8f84ee7ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But at the coming resurrection every knee will bow, of those in heaven, on earth, and beneath the earth,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "0864e8586c977445",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and every tongue will confess that Jesus Christ is Lord, to the glory of God the Father. Amen.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "1ab9a672b25d9e75",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That cloak also has another symbolic meaning. For it represented not only kingship,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "f1dc3f092d5dc2c1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but also revealed the bloodthirstiness and murderousness of the Jews."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s15",
      "source_sha256": "17e7dba0820b4060",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They also put a reed in his hand, so that their sins might be written down."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s16",
      "source_sha256": "ad0ae41ad735cec9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Those who fought against Christ did these things without recognizing the one being crucified—or rather, having willingly blinded themselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s17",
      "source_sha256": "3f92b8d527c28d67",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Yet creation did not recognize its own Maker and Creator. For while the Savior was hanging on the cross,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.242v.s18",
      "source_sha256": "56006d813e55f487",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the visible sun saw Christ, the Sun of righteousness, being abused by lawless men; but [?] enduring"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "756afd928dde5fae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "their insolence, it fled, darkening the earth, since it was unlawful to give light to the eyes of those committing such great lawlessness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "07a7371c7fd8e7b8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Not only did the sun flee, but the earth also shook, unable to endure that Jewish lawlessness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "df2fd6834af4fc5f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It showed and taught that the one being crucified was God. Therefore it could not endure it, but was indignant,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "726e9d1dfb20fb68",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "unwilling to bear upon itself the God-hating Jews. For Cain did not defile the earth so much by killing his brother,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "b6eb2d0abac65414",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor did the giants’ building of the tower weigh so heavily upon the earth, nor did the Sodomites defile it so much with their wrongdoing,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "f25a32073a68055c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor did those who made idols from it, nor did Zechariah’s blood weigh so heavily upon it,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "1dee26437b5b4ec6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as when the Jews committed this great impiety. For this reason even the hard rocks split apart,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "859b9bffdfe2c9ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that they might know that he is the spiritual and living rock."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "f13ec166fa23f772",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it says, “They drank from the spiritual rock that followed them, and the rock was Christ.” Oh, the lack of understanding among the Jews!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "3e866463a409ef6a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The rocks split apart, and they do not perceive it. Lifeless things move, and living people do not believe."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "23dcbcaaf5fa68db",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The curtain of the temple was torn, so that its desolation might be revealed. For the curtain was torn,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "d750dda76bdd7e90",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the things within the temple were laid bare, because Christ had said, “Look, your house is left to you desolate.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "4bc2d8fadb56678a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For everything held in honor among the Jews became desolate because of the killing of Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "85af9d1a6f4c3b8c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And the angels dwelling in the city and in the temple departed from there"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s15",
      "source_sha256": "c3db0ae1319d7aee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and went into the Church. And many bodies of the saints who had fallen asleep rose with Christ,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243r.s16",
      "source_sha256": "c107d34c181e6e54",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that we might know that Christ, having died, will not rise alone, but will raise all"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "62f26cbba7ec18c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who place their hope in him. This is the honored firstfruits, the feast of Easter."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "0721bdb2b76462e6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And these are the mysteries for Christians. We celebrate the resurrection of the dead and the life of the age to come."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "860f7bae5cefacca",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Therefore let us celebrate, not with the leaven of malice and wickedness,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "fff1cd6e51ce1ad2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but with the unleavened bread of purity and truth, believing in the Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "4cc20da213dc2014",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in the Trinity, of one essence and uncreated, believing in the resurrection,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "e774de19a334f65e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "awaiting the Lord coming again, no longer humble but glorious, with heavenly splendor,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "eefe1de931d5aadb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "with radiant angels, with a trumpet, and with fear and joy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "7044c1333a7e4473",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "With joy for the holy and righteous, but with fear for the unrighteous and sinful."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "793a8c49b59698e7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "May the God of peace make us all worthy of the resurrection of the saints, with good deeds [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-pascha#Supr.243v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "66946c49f18c97f4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "and with true faith. For to him belong glory and dominion forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
